    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-catalog\" style=\"background: repeat rgb(255, 255, 255); color: #333333; font-family: &quot;Microsoft JhengHei&quot;, sans-serif; margin: 0px auto; max-width: 800px; padding: 20px;\">\n    \n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgiWitkMpvX_FD1m2c2SqX19-_bokHPlzcYLZzZPWoMtvhy_KXQcPU91BKv0pNcQBNuXc9swldgJsYM6Lm151p9noTHINzi0aGFNwNprMtrSH1GlgmVrdkrgKbm6yPpyLPsXmWK0y89D0_M_Lannwaqm-0Tjo1Bsvu8Y8RCQcUtBFeQuoEexP-aGFRpatO9\" style=\"box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15) 0px 10px 30px; height: auto; max-width: 100%;\" /></div>\n\n    <h2 style=\"color: #333333; font-size: 28px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 40px; text-align: center;\">BONG報第 387 期 • 目錄</h2>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 0px 10px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/ti-e.html\">封面圖</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/e.html\">編輯室ê話</a></h3><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">特稿</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">33</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/kah-siau.html\">感謝kah siàu念<br /> ——追思《台文通訊》前總編輯葉國基兄</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 編輯部</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">做伙來唸詩</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">1</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post.html\">眠夢</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 徐夢陽</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">2</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post_26.html\">大度山</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 崎仔頭赤子</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">3</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post_960.html\">來高雄果嶺自然公園歇喘</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 黃明勝</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">4</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/e_01150203356.html\">海龜ê心聲</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 林雪芬</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">阿瑞 --ā話仙</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">6</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post_771.html\">炭空kah輕便鐵枝路</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 藍春瑞</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">是按怎án-ne生</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">8</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/an-ne-lan-tsit-siu.html\">Lán tsit siū上穩！</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 洪明道</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">台譯se̍h-se̍h唸</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">12</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/seh-seh-liau.html\">《人間失格》鹹酸甜<br /> ——本底無拍算liâu落來翻</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 吳孟儒</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">心內話</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">14</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/hooe.html\">Hōo阿爸ê生日卡片</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 廖子晴</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">36</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post_678.html\">「陳雷先生紀念追思會」筆記</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ Tân Lō͘</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">38</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/e_0452595938.html\">阿母ê紅豆粽</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 珍--a</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">蠻野講堂</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">16</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/blog-post_135.html\">台灣蜂味、人間機蜜：<br /> 蜂蜜、蜜蜂、花</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 主講／陳志東<br /> 記錄／Huī-kun</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">生活ê藝術</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">19</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/e_01657329949.html\">田園離療日誌——清明篇（二）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 鄭清和</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Lán來講看māi</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">23</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/lanmai-ti.html\">出世tī台灣</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 作者／黃土水<br /> 譯者／林東榮</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">29</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/lanmai-501.html\">「501埋葬假憲法行動」<br />   短講發言稿</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 周婉窈</div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">31</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/lanmai-hooe.html\">寫hōo黃仁勳先生ê公開批：<br /> 感謝你提醒世界，台灣囡仔需要學台語</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 董力玄</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">光景bóng uē</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">34</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/bong-ue-echoa.html\">特別ê一chōa文學行讀</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 陳秀枝</div>\n                        </div><h3 style=\"border-bottom-color: rgb(51, 51, 51); border-bottom-style: solid; border-bottom-width: 2px; border-bottom: 2px solid #333; color: black; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; margin-top: 35px; padding-bottom: 5px;\">Sann-kap讀小說</h3>\n                        <div style=\"align-items: baseline; border-bottom-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-bottom-style: dotted; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom: 1px dotted #ccc; display: flex; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 2px;\">\n                            <div style=\"color: #666666; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; font-weight: bold; width: 45px;\">39</div>\n                            <div style=\"flex: 1 1 0%; font-weight: 500;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2016/06/sann-kap-ka-choah.html\">Ka-choa̍h人（三）</a></div>\n                            <div style=\"color: #777777; font-size: 16px; margin-left: 10px;\">/ 杜信龍</div>\n                        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiCa8lvEAYIHfAGDOrPqBpQ5_W-vf3xKEbRzMsGOD3_-r9ScPQb7LEzK-pJpKtLWKdHp6am9ojSm1NIzbupoBJI7OergzjHQiDrouAdlTUqyPQyrRXvE7VG2b6wlfr4Y-EO0gi4LqTAIPNd06BewklS1qT7K_N7wsrLBhR3BSuWrcjtt2sBkdBV7lIHsA-7\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgQsdRoaTLhKggsUWG7_Cojve2c-AL5rgVkuMub6jiVK6sVHBUnUHsmcLY0Rq_zKOqAIuZTugIdbDWvfAwEZfMwr0SmFuGcKIrGXICwRV_hE8vpDu7c1o9CVEfeboLSIBbsHLftaEqlZuaCBJHlQ0YH8Pkon8NRbHbvkp_pnup7urt6eXM2emez0PKEa6hk\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n        <div style=\"margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgoptY4vK03vRskmhcL5B9ePRAiAav6Zxrj668QV2EmxF6SQKrv-5F11C-a4UIqKeY8sfELSFVzucQaz1VI-d3B2ElYXTbWhuZqT9BTeL4GaHUjcqCho2r0AdSvrUROIJXwNFiVReFwzuYEJq5aQ9qUkze_8TI5hn_INomHCdAwPcVYYNYrE0nWBhbdVl41\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; height: auto; width: 100%;\" /></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin-top: 20px; overflow: hidden;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, serif; padding: 30px; text-align: center;\">\n            <div style=\"font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 15px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 387期，2026年06月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br />\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin-top: 15px;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br />\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"border-top-color: rgb(238, 238, 238); border-top-style: solid; border-top-width: 1px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
